@startuml
title Sequence - UC-12 Xem báo cáo & thống kê
actor "Admin Dashboard" as AdminUI
participant "API Gateway" as API
participant "Auth Service" as Auth
participant "Analytics Service" as Analytics
database "DB" as DB

AdminUI -> API : GET /reports?type=utilization
API -> Auth : validate admin token
Auth --> API : OK
API -> Analytics : fetch report
Analytics -> DB : query aggregates
DB --> Analytics : dataset
Analytics --> API : report data
API --> AdminUI : render charts/tables
@enduml